losure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133840106,imgsize-68109.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2015, Mark Pentecost paid $14.5 million for a 104-acre Florida island; after pouring millions...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133836447.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Mark Pentecost has listed his stunning private island retreat for a staggering eighty-nine million dollars. Acquired eleven years ago for a mere fourteen point five million, this one hundred four-acre island boasts a private golf course and twenty-nine potential residential plots. As the founder of It Works!, Pentecost has skillfully developed this paradise into both a business and family haven, offering unparalleled fishing and coastal access near Boca Grande.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2015-mark-pentecost-paid-14-5-million-for-a-104-acre-florida-island-after-pouring-millions-into-upgrades-it-is-asking-89-million-with-a-9-hole-golf-course-and-29-developable-lots/articleshow/133836447.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2015-mark-pentecost-paid-14-5-million-for-a-104-acre-florida-island-after-pouring-millions-into-upgrades-it-is-asking-89-million-with-a-9-hole-golf-course-and-29-developable-lots/articleshow/133836447.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T18:51:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133838688,imgsize-1559030.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fire Island glass house drops to $3.995M, $1.3M above Cherry Grove record after no buyer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133834575.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Crest House, a four-bedroom glass estate in Fire Island’s Cherry Grove, has drawn more than 350 viewers since being listed for $5.25 million in July 2026. Despite the attention, the property has not found a buyer. Its price was first cut to $4.85 million and has now fallen to $3.995 million. The current asking price is still far above Cherry Grove’s record sale of $2.7 million.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-fire-island-glass-house-drew-350-viewers-at-5-25-million-but-no-buyer-after-1-255-million-in-cuts-its-3-995-million-ask-is-still-nearly-1-3-million-above-cherry-groves-record-sale/articleshow/133834575.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-fire-island-glass-house-drew-350-viewers-at-5-25-million-but-no-buyer-after-1-255-million-in-cuts-its-3-995-million-ask-is-still-nearly-1-3-million-above-cherry-groves-record-sale/articleshow/133834575.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133837541,imgsize-115358.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California mosque shooting: FBI warned parents about teen suspect’s dark-web activity days before attack]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133838744.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-mosque-shooting-fbi-warned-parents-about-teen-suspects-dark-web-activity-days-before-attack/articleshow/133838744.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-mosque-shooting-fbi-warned-parents-about-teen-suspects-dark-web-activity-days-before-attack/articleshow/133838744.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T19:02:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/d