]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133833038.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ken Kesey’s psychedelic “Furthur” bus has returned to San Francisco after decades and is now the centrepiece of a new Grateful Dead exhibition. The bus was used by Kesey and his Merry Band of Pranksters during their 1964 cross-country journey, which helped spread the emerging psychedelic counterculture. The exhibition also features Jerry Garcia’s BMW and will launch an effort to restore the now-dilapidated bus.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1964-ken-kesey-drove-the-psychedelic-furthur-bus-across-america-and-helped-ignite-the-counterculture-60-years-later-the-dilapidated-icon-is-back-in-san-francisco-for-a-restoration-campaign/articleshow/133833038.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1964-ken-kesey-drove-the-psychedelic-furthur-bus-across-america-and-helped-ignite-the-counterculture-60-years-later-the-dilapidated-icon-is-back-in-san-francisco-for-a-restoration-campaign/articleshow/133833038.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T16:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133833519,imgsize-1062440.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Police slow to respond as masked men block roads to UK’s Dover port in anti-immigration protest: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133835614.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/police-slow-to-respond-as-masked-men-block-roads-to-uks-dover-port-in-anti-immigration-protest-report/articleshow/133835614.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/police-slow-to-respond-as-masked-men-block-roads-to-uks-dover-port-in-anti-immigration-protest-report/articleshow/133835614.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T17:01:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133835614,imgsize-853152.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[93-year-old Cleveland bridge closes after analysis finds severe floor-beam deterioration]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133831650.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Cleveland bridge that opened in 1933 has been closed until further notice after new analysis found more extensive deterioration in its floor beams. The closure comes as the Ohio Department of Transportation was preparing a major rehabilitation project, with construction tentatively planned for 2028. Officials said the decision was made for public safety.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-cleveland-bridge-opened-in-1933-and-was-being-designed-for-a-2028-rehabilitation-new-analysis-found-deeper-floor-beam-deterioration-forcing-officials-to-close-the-93-year-old-bridge-immediately/articleshow/133831650.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-cleveland-bridge-opened-in-1933-and-was-being-designed-for-a-2028-rehabilitation-new-analysis-found-deeper-floor-beam-deterioration-forcing-officials-to-close-the-93-year-old-bridge-immediately/articleshow/133831650.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-06T15:26:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133832728,imgsize-1609306.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[London court clears extradition of Indian-origin pharmacist accused in Hyderabad murder case]]></title